{"unit_id": "tag:06L8:proof", "translation": "回顾可预表函子（prorepresentable functor）是形变函子（deformation functor），见例<REF_0001>。因此，若<MATH_0001>等价（equivalent）于函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors），且该群胚光滑（smooth）并可预表（prorepresentable），则条件 (1)、(2) 和 (3) 由引理<REF_0002>的 (1)、(2) 和 (3) 推出。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n反过来，假设条件 (1)、(2) 和 (3) 成立。条件 (1) 蕴涵 (S1) 和 (S2) 得到满足，见引理<REF_0003>。由引理<REF_0004>，存在泛形式对象（versal formal object）<MATH_0002>。置<MATH_0003>，相应的映射（map）<MATH_0004>是光滑的（smooth）（这就是泛形式对象（versal formal object）的定义）。设<MATH_0005>是引理<REF_0005>中由映射（map）<MATH_0006>构造的函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors）。由引理<REF_0006>可知，<MATH_0007>是光滑的（smooth）函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors），且<MATH_0008>是等价（equivalence）。由引理<REF_0007>可知，<MATH_0009>是可预表的（prorepresentable）。因此<MATH_0010>就是<MATH_0011>所要求的呈示（presentation）。\n", "allowed_english": ["S"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "prorepresentable functor", "target_term": "可预表函子"}, {"source_term": "deformation functor", "target_term": "形变函子"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表"}, {"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "泛形式对象"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的"}, {"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "泛形式对象"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表的"}, {"source_term": "presentation", "target_term": "呈示"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "prorepresentable functor", "target_term": "可预表函子", "context": "所给函子性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "deformation functor", "target_term": "形变函子", "context": "所给函子类别，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "范畴等价，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚", "context": "所给群胚，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "泛形式对象", "context": "所构造形式对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "相应映射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的", "context": "映射或群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价", "context": "所给等价，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表的", "context": "所给对象性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "presentation", "target_term": "呈示", "context": "所构造呈示，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06TD:title", "translation": "关于极小性（minimality）的注记", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "minimality", "target_term": "极小性"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "minimality", "target_term": "极小性", "context": "小节讨论的性质，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06TD:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本章的主要定理是上面的定理<REF_0001>。它完整描述了<MATH_0001>上具有呈示（presentation）的群胚上余纤维化的范畴（categories cofibred in groupoids），该呈示由光滑的（smooth）、可预表的（prorepresentable）函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors）给出。本节简要讨论第<REF_0002>节和第<REF_0003>节中讨论的极小性（minimality）如何用于得到“极小的（minimal）”光滑的（smooth）、可预表的（prorepresentable）呈示（presentation）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "presentation", "target_term": "呈示"}, {"source_term": "categories cofibred in groupoids", "target_term": "群胚上余纤维化的范畴"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表的"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚"}, {"source_term": "minimality", "target_term": "极小性"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小的"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表的"}, {"source_term": "presentation", "target_term": "呈示"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "presentation", "target_term": "呈示", "context": "群胚呈示，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "categories cofibred in groupoids", "target_term": "群胚上余纤维化的范畴", "context": "所描述范畴，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的", "context": "群胚或呈示性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表的", "context": "群胚或呈示性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚", "context": "呈示中的群胚，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimality", "target_term": "极小性", "context": "呈示的极小性，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小的", "context": "呈示性质，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06KM:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的光滑的（smooth）、可预表的（prorepresentable）函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>若群胚（groupoid）<MATH_0004>是完全不连通的（totally disconnected），即不同对象（objects）之间没有态射（morphisms），则称<MATH_0003>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>规范化的（normalized）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0003>我们称<MATH_0005>是<TEXTITOPEN_0002>极小的（minimal）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果<MATH_0006>由<MATH_0007>的极小泛形式对象（minimal versal formal object）给出。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表的"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚"}, {"source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "totally disconnected", "target_term": "完全不连通的"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "normalized", "target_term": "规范化的"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小的"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal object", "target_term": "极小泛形式对象"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表的", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚", "context": "所给群胚，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚", "context": "所给群胚，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "totally disconnected", "target_term": "完全不连通的", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象", "context": "群胚对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "群胚态射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "normalized", "target_term": "规范化的", "context": "所定义群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小的", "context": "所定义群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal object", "target_term": "极小泛形式对象", "context": "所给形式对象，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06TD:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这两个概念之间的区别与条件（<REF_0001>）和（<REF_0002>）之间的区别有关，并且当<MATH_0001>可分（separable）时消失。此外，规范化的（normalized）、光滑的（smooth）、可预表的（prorepresentable）函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors）是极小的（minimal），如下一个引理所示。下面给出精确陈述。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分"}, {"source_term": "normalized", "target_term": "规范化的"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表的"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分", "context": "域扩张性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "normalized", "target_term": "规范化的", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表的", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚", "context": "所给群胚，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小的", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06KN:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的光滑的（smooth）、可预表的（prorepresentable）函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0003>是规范化的（normalized），当且仅当态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>在切空间（tangent spaces）上诱导同构（isomorphism），并且\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0005>是极小的（minimal），当且仅当<MATH_0006>的核（kernel）包含于<MATH_0007>的像（image）中。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表的"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚"}, {"source_term": "normalized", "target_term": "规范化的"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "tangent spaces", "target_term": "切空间"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小的"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可预表的", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚", "context": "所给群胚，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "normalized", "target_term": "规范化的", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所给态射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "tangent spaces", "target_term": "切空间", "context": "所给切空间，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "切空间同构，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小的", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核", "context": "所给线性映射的核，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "所给线性映射的像，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
